I have not graduated from university so
I'm a,

00:40:51.570 --> 00:40:52.120
&gt;&gt; Not yet.

00:40:52.120 --> 00:40:53.180
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH] Not yet.

00:40:53.180 --> 00:40:55.473
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; But,

00:40:55.473 --> 00:40:59.061
enormous amount of respect
to this institution.

00:40:59.061 --> 00:41:02.260
Enormous amount of respect
that solutions and

00:41:02.260 --> 00:41:05.714
innovations in the way
that how to form humanity.

00:41:05.714 --> 00:41:09.440
And society better through innovation and
business coming out into society.

00:41:09.440 --> 00:41:14.149
You guys are inspiring us all,
